; a history — modular synthesis, one night at a time
; lift (the rocker) rides between the scenes; the faders are written next to each scene

1964 the moog room
------------------
; a clock, a melody that rewrites itself, a ladder filter. lean1 cutoff, lean2 how much it changes
the clock is tram 4
the book is notebook 8
the tune is pufferfish 1
the osc is turntable 2
the filter is shaft 1
the env is sleep

clock.eighth -> book.clock env.gate
book -40> tune -> osc.pitch
osc.saw osc.square -> filter
env -> filter.cut
lean1 -> filter.cut
lean2 -> book.change
filter -> ears lamp
lift.up -> journey.next
lift.down -> journey.back

1965 the buchla basement
------------------------
; west coast: a complex oscillator, folds, bongos from Euclidean pulses. lean1 timbre, lean2 hits
the clock is tram 4
the steps are maze 13
the voice is twin 2
the peaks are mountains
the gate is window
the drift is wander 1

clock.eighth -> steps.clock
steps.hit >| gate.light
lean2 -> steps.hits
drift ~> voice.index
lean1 -> voice.timbre peaks.fold
voice -> peaks -> gate -> ears lamp
lift.up -> journey.next
lift.down -> journey.back

1974 serge night
----------------
; a slope that cycles, a comparator, a ring modulator and a frequency shifter. lean1 shift, lean2 slope
the slope is stairs
the cmp is threshold
the osc is turntable 4
the ring is pulley 3
the portal is stargate 1

slope.end -> slope.start
lean2 -> slope.rise slope.fall
slope -> cmp
40 -> cmp.ref
cmp.gate -> osc.sync
osc.tri -> ring -> portal
lean1 -> portal.shift
portal.up -> left
portal.down -> right
slope -> lamp.track
lift.up -> journey.next
lift.down -> journey.back

1980 the drum machine party
---------------------------
; a map of beats, three drums, a tape echo. lean1 x, lean2 y, lean3 density, door1 a fill
the clock is tram 4
the beats are party
the kick is trebuchet 1
the snare is balloon 1
the hat is grill 1
the echo is dub 3
the fill is fire

clock.eighth -> beats.clock
lean1 -> beats.x
lean2 -> beats.y
lean3 -> beats.density
beats.kick -> kick
beats.snare -> snare
beats.hat fill -> hat
door1 -> fill
kick -> ears
snare hat -> echo
echo -> ears
beats.accent -> lamp.play
lift.up -> journey.next
lift.down -> journey.back

1995 ciat-lonbarde
------------------
; a rungler, fighting pendants, crackle and a spring. lean1 chaos, lean2 tilt
the goblins are goblins 3
the pendants are pendant 2
the glitter is glitter
the spring is cabin 2

lean1 -> goblins.chaos glitter.chaos
goblins.rungler ~> pendants.pitch
lean2 -> pendants.tilt
goblins -> spring
pendants ~> spring
glitter.dust -40> spring
spring -> ears lamp
lift.up -> journey.next
lift.down -> journey.back

2016 eurorack
-------------
; a cellular automaton plucks sympathetic strings; hold door1 to freeze. lean1 chord, lean2 plate decay
the clock is tram 4
the pads are lilypads 30
the pluck is rebar 4
the strings are wires 2
the past is memories 1
the plate is hotel

clock.eighth -> pads.clock
pads.pulse -> pluck
pads.cells -20> pluck.pitch
pluck -> strings
lean1 -> strings.chord
strings -> past
door1 -> past.hold
past -> plate
lean2 -> plate.decay
plate.l -> left
plate.r -> right
pads.alive -> lamp.track
lift.up -> journey.next
lift.down -> journey.back
